# Mining ''Borg/Prospector

**Alignments.** Any.

Mining is dangerous work - cave-ins, landslides, explosions and poison gas are
only the start of it, and the gold, silver, copper, iron and coal are a long way
down. Nobody quite knows who first thought of using bionics for it, but the
augmentation and the full conversions are common across the Western
Territories.

Mining ''Borgs are built for strength and for digging. The hands and forearms
take interchangeable drills, lasers and torches for cutting rock, and the spine,
neck and shoulders are reinforced and made as heavy as they can be.

Those who tire of prospecting, or who have nothing but bad luck, may give it up
and turn builder or adventurer - though always with an eye out for precious
metals and stones and the chance of a big strike.

## Lore

Also known as the Prospector, the Dirt Digger and the Tunnel Rat.
